        run("Bethany, who leads our strategy work, has over two decades of hands-on experience across nearly every role inside a med spa, so she's not approaching your business from the outside. She's built and run this before.", { hl: true }),
      ]),
      cellPara("Most clinics think they need more leads, but we usually find they're losing significant revenue from the opportunities they already have. Our job is to identify those bottlenecks and implement the systems that create predictable, profitable growth."),
